Package: subsystem-ramdump
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Subsystem Ramdump Service
 QTI subsystem ramdump service collects peripheral subsystem ramdumps and
 saves them to a path on the storage device. Used when SSR is disabled and
 a subsystem such as ADSP or modem crashes, to capture a RAM dump for
 debugging. Typically used during development; SSR is recommended for
 commercial devices.
